    <title>Python 3.10 end of life</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Here am I floating &#39;round my tin can&lt;br&gt;
Far above the moon&lt;br&gt;
Planet Earth is blue&lt;br&gt;
And there&#39;s nothing I can do&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Five years in orbit. Mission complete. ;)&lt;/p&gt;</content>
